{"availability":"available","full":"bobddadoo/pixel-shader-academy","name":"pixel-shader-academy","description":"Pixel Shader Academy — landing site. Learn GLSL fragment shaders, stage by stage. Demo: shader.dolstep.com","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-19T13:29:36Z","updated":"2026-05-19T14:17:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shader.dolstep.com","topics":["education","glsl","indie-game","itch-io","learning-game","shader","threejs","typescript","webgl"],"demo":"https://shader.dolstep.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:44:43.890Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T00:44:43.890Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T00:44:43.890Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:14.967Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:12.715Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:03:38.155Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:48:18.565Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T00:44:43.890Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🎮 Play the Free Demo → · 🛒 Buy on itch.io → · 🌐 Landing site","Pixel Shader Academy is a browser-based, stage-by-stage GLSL fragment shader playground. Write code on the right, watch the preview on top, read the lesson on the left, hit Run (or Ctrl+Enter), and let the Check button compare your output against the reference solution.","No install. No toolchain. No Node, no Unity, no headaches. Open a tab and start writing shaders."],"features":["A real curriculum, not a pile of demos. Every stage has authored lesson pages (EN + 한국어) that explain the concept, the GLSL builtins involved, and a hint-driven challenge.","Auto-grading at the press of a button. The Check button renders your shader and the reference solution at multiple time samples and scores the per-channel difference. Tolerances are generous — no nitpicking over…","Instant feedback. CodeMirror 6 editor, Three.js fullscreen quad, Ctrl+Enter to compile. GLSL errors come back with named lines, not ERROR: 0:42.","Texture support. Upload an image, crop it square with the built-in cropper, and sample it via utexture from stage 6 onward.","Light and dark themes. Cool-gray light palette for daylight, deep-purple dark mode for late-night shader hacking."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bobddadoo/pixel-shader-academy/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"56e2444e4c2eb421950b6c22f5d2b9661977bb629b898fbae8d409db1780b177","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:15.072Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:18.656Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🎮 Play the Free Demo → · 🛒 Buy on itch.io → · 🌐 Landing site","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bobddadoo/pixel-shader-academy/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"56e2444e4c2eb421950b6c22f5d2b9661977bb629b898fbae8d409db1780b177","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bobddadoo/pixel-shader-academy/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:18.656Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-19T14:17:22Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bobddadoo/pixel-shader-academy/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:18.657Z","hash":"56e2444e4c2eb421950b6c22f5d2b9661977bb629b898fbae8d409db1780b177","originalBytes":3791,"storedBytes":3791,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:18.658Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://shader.dolstep.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T20:14:14.630Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T20:14:14.630Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-13T20:14:14.630Z","target":"https://shader.dolstep.com/#stage-1","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T20:14:14.630Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T20:14:14.630Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://shader.dolstep.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T20:14:14.630Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T20:14:14.630Z"},"scre